(ii)
inattention to class teaching or class work ;
(iii)
irregular attendance;
(iv)
indulgence in any noise calculated to disturb his fellows :
(v)
use of key to text books ;
(vi)
unhygienic habits such as spitting on the floor or on the walls of a room or verandah;
(vii)
